<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">As a Partner Marketing Specialist, you will play a crucial role in developing and executing co-marketing strategies to drive mutual growth and enhance global brand awareness. You will collaborate with our esteemed partners and cross-functional internal teams to create, manage, and optimize marketing campaigns that elevate Teamwork Commerce in our partner ecosystem. This job reports to the Director of Partnerships with a dotted line to the Director of Marketing. </p>
<h4>Key Responsibilities:</h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">Develop, execute, and manage partner marketing campaigns, including but not limited to webinars, content marketing, social media, and events.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">Collaborate with partners to identify co-marketing opportunities that align with the strategic goals of both parties.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">Maintain clear communication with partners to ensure effective and efficient execution of marketing initiatives.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">Track, measure, and report on the performance and impact of partner marketing campaigns.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">Develop marketing assets and collateral in collaboration with creative teams to support partner marketing initiatives.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">Foster positive relationships with partners, acting as a liaison between them and our internal teams.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">Stay informed on industry trends, competitor activities, and emerging marketing strategies to ensure competitive edge and innovation</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4>Qualifications</h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">Bachelor’s degree in Marketing, Business, or related field. </p>
</li>
<li>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">1-5 years of experience in partner marketing, channel marketing, or related roles.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">Strong understanding of the Retail and/or ecommerce landscape and market trends.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">Proficient in various marketing technologies and platforms for analytics, automation, and content creation.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">Exceptional communication and interpersonal skills.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">Strong analytical abilities, with a focus on data-driven decision-making.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">Ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously and adapt to changing priorities.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">Creativity and innovation in developing effective marketing strategies to reach target audiences</p>
</li>
</ul>
